Attributions
============

1. EasyOCR (JaidedAI)
---------------------
EasyOCR is NOT used by `olchiki-ocr` in any form: it is not a runtime
dependency (the core runs on ONNX Runtime), not a training dependency (the
`[train]` tier uses the DTRB scripts directly), and not an export dependency
(the `[export]` tier vendors its own model definition). It is attributed
here because the trained model's heritage -- the pretrained starting weights
and the "gen2" `None-VGG-BiLSTM-CTC` recognition architecture -- traces to
the EasyOCR ecosystem. This attribution is preserved to honor that lineage
and the Apache-2.0 terms of the upstream weights/architecture.

    EasyOCR
